{
  "title": "Ziyarate Janabe Habib ibn Mazahir (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَلسَّلامُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْعَبْدُ الصَّالِحُ الْمُطِیْعُ لِلّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha al`abdu alssalihu almuti`u lillahi\nPeace be upon you, O righteous servant, obedient to Allah\nوَلِرَسُوْلِهٖ وَلِاَمِیْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ وَلِفَاطِمَۃَ الزَّهْرَائِ وَالْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَیْنِ\nwa lirasulihi wa li'amiri almu'minina wa lifatimata alzzahra'i wa alhasani wa alhusayni\nand to His Messenger, and to the Commander of the Faithful, and to Fatimah al-Zahra', and to al-Hasan and al-Husain,\nعَلَیْهِمُ السَّلاَمُ الْغَرِیْبُ الْمُوَاسِیْ\n`alayhimu alssalamu alghariybu almuwasi\npeace be upon them – O stranger, O consoling companion.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ جَاهَدْتَ فِیْ سَبِیْلِ اللّٰهِ\nashhadu annaka jahadta fi sabili allahi\nI bear witness that you strove in the way of Allah,\nوَنَصَرْتَ الْحُسَیْنَ ابْنَ بِنْتِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nwa nasarta alhusayna bna binti rasuli allahi\nand you supported al-Husain, the son of the daughter of the Messenger of Allah,\nوَوَاسَیْتَ بِنَفْسِكَ وَبَذَلْتَ مُهْجَتَكَ\nwa wasayta binafsika wa badhalta muhjataka\nand you stood by him with your own self and gave up your very life-blood,\nفَعَلَیْكَ مِنَ اللّٰهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ التَّامُّ\nfa`alayka mina allahi alssalamu alttammu\nso upon you be the complete peace from Allah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْقَمَرُ الزَّاهِرُ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha alqamaru alzzahiru\nPeace be upon you, O radiant moon,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حَبِیْبَ ابْنَ مُظَاهِرِ الْاَسَدِیْ\nalssalamu `alayka ya habiba bna muzahiri al-asadi\npeace be upon you, O Habib the son of Muzahir al-Asadi,\nوَرَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ۔\nwa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\nand Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you."
}
